falls du es brauchst. Max: Danke euch beiden! Ihr seid die Besten!","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Nach der Feier","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Karla, ich schenke dir dieses Buch zum Geburtstag.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Oh, danke!","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Zeigst du mir auch die Fotos vom letzten Sommer?","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Klar, ich schicke sie dir heute Abend.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Perfekt, ich freue mich schon!","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Karla, ich schenke dir dieses Buch zum Geburtstag.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Oh, danke! Zeigst du mir auch die Fotos vom letzten Sommer?","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Klar, ich schicke sie dir heute Abend.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Perfekt, ich freue mich schon!","speaker":"Karla","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_021_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Ich schenke ihm ein Album von seinem Lieblingssänger.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Dein Freund hat Geburtstag. Was schenkst du ihm?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Ich erkläre ihr die Aufgabe noch einmal genau.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Deine Kurspartnerin versteht die Aufgabe nicht. Was machst du?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich zeige ihm den Weg und gebe ihm einen Plan.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-21-verben-dativ-akkusativ","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Am Fahrkartenschalter fragt ein Fahrgast nach dem Weg.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},